<section id="A10" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix Appendix J. </span>Ethics, License, and Artifact Statement</h2>

<div id="A10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A10.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Reproducibility Statement.</span> Code will be released under the MIT License upon publication.</p>
</div>
<div id="A10.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A10.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Artifact Documentation.</span> The repository will include usage instructions, intended use, and limitations. All artifacts are intended for academic, non-commercial use.</p>
</div>
<div id="A10.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A10.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Data Privacy.</span> No personally identifiable or sensitive information is present in our data.</p>
</div>
